ated\": \"2026-05-23\",\n242\t    \"assignee\": \"engineering-frontend-developer\",\n243\t    \"completed\": \"2026-05-23 08:24:50\"\n244\t  },\n245\t  {\n246\t    \"id\": 28,\n247\t    \"status\": \"done\",\n248\t    \"title\": \"三消提审材料补充\",\n249\t    \"description\": \"为 D:/game-projects/douyin-match3/ 准备抖音小游戏提审材料：1)生成1024x1024应用图标 2)准备3-5张宣传截图 3)编写隐私政策页面 4)适配穿山甲SDK真实接入代码 5)JS/CSS压缩 6)检查game.json和project.config.json配置完整性。参考GDD.md中的提审要求。\",\n250\t    \"created\": \"2026-05-23\",\n251\t    \"assignee\": \"engineering-frontend-developer\",\n252\t    \"completed\": \"2026-05-23 08:35:21\"\n253\t  },\n254\t  {\n255\t    \"id\": 29,\n256\t    \"status\": \"done\",\n257\t    \"title\": \"成语闯关W3: 变现+上线\",\n258\t    \"description\": \"为 D:/game-projects/douyin-idiom/ 完成 W3(变现+上线): 1)穿山甲SDK集成,复用三消项目(D:/game-projects/douyin-match3/src/js/ad-config.js和AdManager.js)的广告框架,适配6个广告位(揭示字/去干扰/双倍结算/续命/关卡间插屏/每日签到翻倍)+频率控制 2)数据埋点,复用三消埋点框架,覆盖15种事件(GAME_START/TUTORIAL_STEP/LEVEL_START/QUESTION_ANSWER等) 3)提审材料:隐私政策/应用图标/宣传截图,参照三消项目的tools/目录 4)包体优化+JS压缩,目标<2MB 5)更新game.json和project.config.json 参考GDD: D:/game-projects/douyin-idiom/GDD.md 第7-8章\",\n259\t    \"created\": \"2026-05-23\",\n260\t    \"assignee\": \"engineering-frontend-developer\",\n261\t    \"completed\": \"2026-05-23 08:49:06\"\n262\t  },\n263\t  {\n264\t    \"id\": 30,\n265\t    \"status\": \"pending\",\n266\t    \"title\": \"修仙自动化工厂 Steam GDD\",\n267\t    \"description\": \"为Steam独立游戏修仙自动化工厂编写完整GDD。核心：修仙主题放置自动化游戏，融合idle与工厂自动化。进度系统：炼气到化神。自动化：灵石采集>灵药种植>丹炉炼丹>丹药分配。技术：HTML5\\\\Canvas+Electron打包Steam。输出到D;C:\\\\Program Files\\\\Git\\\\game-projects\\\\steam-cultivation-factory\\\\GDD.md。参考D;C:\\\\Program Files\\\\Git\\\\game-projects\\\\research\\\\steam-indie-market-2026-05-23.md和D;C:\\\\Program Files\\\\Git\\\\game-projects\\\\douyin-match3\\\\GDD.md\",\n268\t    \"created\": \"2026-05-23\",\n269\t    \"assignee\": \"engineering-frontend-developer\"\n270\t  }\n271\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b0aded01-016f-4428-